{"t": 1785663175.522, "name": "merge_intervals", "lang": "Python", "contract": "Implement merge_intervals: merge all overlapping intervals given as [start, end] pairs and return them sorted by start", "code": "def merge_intervals(intervals: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Merges all overlapping intervals given as [start, end] pairs and returns them sorted by start.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not intervals:\n        return []\n\n    # Sort intervals by the start time\n    intervals.sort(key=lambda x: x[0])\n\n    merged = [intervals[0]]\n    for current in intervals[1:]:\n        last_merged = merged[-1]\n        if current[0] <= last_merged[1]:  # Overlapping intervals\n            merged[-1][1] = max(last_merged[1], current[1])\n        else:\n            merged.append(current)\n\n    return merged", "symbol": "storage/hard/merge_intervals.py::merge_intervals", "embedding": [-0.11778119206428528, 0.9699766635894775, -3.9068965911865234, -1.4769039154052734, 0.42016077041625977, -0.7323173880577087, 0.17613431811332703, -0.17085149884223938, -0.07237490266561508, -0.3154439926147461, -0.9441366195678711, 0.9598381519317627, 1.1880502700805664, -0.1920117437839508, -0.606782853603363, -0.8227079510688782, -0.19872817397117615, -0.16172027587890625, -0.6561065316200256, -0.16241928935050964, -0.05978613719344139, 0.008637865073978901, -0.9285967350006104, -1.2112585306167603, 1.3707789182662964, 1.175518274307251, -0.0007759786676615477, 0.13949304819107056, -0.7737669348716736, 0.3010406792163849, 1.2976875305175781, -0.24365223944187164, 0.5980433821678162, 0.0662459060549736, -0.7250884771347046, 0.3276718556880951, 0.3842827081680298, -1.2044609785079956, -0.30710068345069885, -0.020422114059329033, -0.12004461139440536, 0.9158810377120972, 0.9433095455169678, -0.022775014862418175, 1.0140169858932495, -1.6462726593017578, 1.8775994777679443, 0.6518445611000061, 1.030182123184204, -1.0736817121505737, -0.05390359088778496, 0.5199815034866333, -0.33090680837631226, -0.695