{"t": 1785663257.106, "name": "merge_intervals", "lang": "Python", "contract": "Implement merge_intervals: merge all overlapping intervals given as [start, end] pairs and return them sorted by start", "code": "def merge_intervals(intervals: list) -> list:\n    \"\"\"\n    Merges all overlapping intervals given as [start, end] pairs and returns them sorted by start.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not intervals:\n        return []\n\n    # Sort intervals by the start time\n    intervals.sort(key=lambda x: x[0])\n\n    merged = [intervals[0]]\n    for current in intervals[1:]:\n        last_merged = merged[-1]\n        if current[0] <= last_merged[1]:  # Overlapping intervals\n            merged[-1][1] = max(last_merged[1], current[1])\n        else:\n            merged.append(current)\n\n    return merged", "symbol": "storage/hard/merge_intervals.py::merge_intervals"}
